{"type": "concept", "subtype": "definition", "title": "同理心的定义与作用", "content": "同理心是孩子非常重要的能力，通过提问帮助孩子了解其他人的感受。富有同理心的孩子长大后更能平衡和管理自己的情绪，处于情绪健康状态，也更善于处理人际关系矛盾，最终拥有和谐关系。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["同理心", "情绪管理", "人际关系"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-dbddd7fc07bd-c001:a001", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-dbddd7fc07bd", "blocks": ["b00006"], "source_kind": "B"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [], "knowledge_units": ["s-dbddd7fc07bd-c001:u001"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "definition", "title": "诠释方法的定义", "content": "诠释是左脑引导的最后一个方法，不是替孩子解释行为背后的原因，而是通过提问帮助他们理解自己行为背后的动机。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["诠释", "左脑引导", "提问"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": ["术语可能有误：原文为“权势”，结合上下文应为“诠释”"], "id": "s-dbddd7fc07bd-c001:a002", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-dbddd7fc07bd", "blocks": ["b00008"], "source_kind": "B"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [{"target": "s-dbddd7fc07bd-c001:a003", "kind": "example_of", "condition": "提问示例是诠释方法定义的实例。", "reason": "诠释方法的提问示例展示了如何通过提问帮助孩子理解行为动机，是诠释方法定义的具体实例。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "revised", "review_notes": "方向已修正为示例指向定义；原方向反了。"}, {"target": "s-dbddd7fc07bd-c001:r001", "kind": "same_source_point", "condition": "Read both records and the shared source point; this is not a causal assertion.", "reason": "s-dbddd7fc07bd-c001:u002", "evidence": "point_source_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-dbddd7fc07bd-c001:u002"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "诠释方法的提问示例", "content": "通过提问帮助孩子思考行为背后的原因，例如：你觉得为什么刚才你选择抢走弟弟的东西，而不是向他借呢？或者你觉得这一次为什么考试没有考好呢？是因为时间不够吗？还是因为确实题太难了？", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["提问", "行为动机", "诠释"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-dbddd7fc07bd-c001:a003", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-dbddd7fc07bd", "blocks": ["b00008"], "source_kind": "B"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-dbddd7fc07bd-c001:r003", "kind": "same_source_point", "condition": "Read both records and the shared source point; this is not a causal assertion.", "reason": "s-dbddd7fc07bd-c001:u003", "evidence": "point_source_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-dbddd7fc07bd-c001:u003"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "前额叶在回答问题中的作用", "content": "当孩子听到问题时，前额叶（原文为FRONTOBOB，中文翻译额夜，疑为额叶）开始运作，处理大脑各部分吸收的信息，并将处理后的答案或决定通过身体传递出去。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["前额叶", "大脑机制", "信息处理"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": ["术语可能有误：FRONTOBOB 应为 frontal lobe（额叶），原文中文翻译为额夜，疑为额叶"], "id": "s-dbddd7fc07bd-c001:a004", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-dbddd7fc07bd", "blocks": ["b00010"], "source_kind": "B"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-dbddd7fc07bd-c001:a005", "kind": "causes", "condition": "当问题带有负面批评性质时", "reason": "a004 说明前额叶处理问题并传递答案，a005 说明负面批评性问题导致孩子得出错误答案并在行为中传递，因此前额叶的运作是负面问题影响行为的机制。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-dbddd7fc07bd-c001:u004"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "负面批评性问题对孩子大脑的影响", "content": "如果孩子没有考好，家长问“你怎么这个考试就考不好呢？你为什么就不能多用点心，多努力一下呢？”，孩子的大脑会开始回答“为什么我不努力？为什么我不用心？”，但由于大脑未发育成熟，无法辩证全面分析，特别是带有负面批评性质的问题，孩子容易得出畸形而错误的答案，并在今后行为中传递出去。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["负面问题", "大脑发育", "行为影响"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-dbddd7fc07bd-c001:a005", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-dbddd7fc07bd", "blocks": ["b00010"], "source_kind": "B"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-dbddd7fc07bd-c001:a006", "kind": "example_of", "condition": null, "reason": "a006 是讲师个人经历，被负面提问导致成绩差，是 a005 负面批评性问题导致错误答案的具体案例。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-dbddd7fc07bd-c001:r004", "kind": "same_source_point", "condition": "Read both records and the shared source point; this is not a causal assertion.", "reason": "s-dbddd7fc07bd-c001:u005", "evidence": "point_source_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-dbddd7fc07bd-c001:u005"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "case", "subtype": "case", "title": "讲师个人经历：中国读书时被负面提问导致成绩差", "content": "讲师在中国读书时，老师认为他不好好读书，整天问“你为什么不好好读书？你为什么这么懒惰？你为什么上课开小差？你为什么不听话？”，那时他的成绩非常差。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["负面提问", "成绩差", "个人经历"], "evidence": "reported_case", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-dbddd7fc07bd-c001:a006", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-dbddd7fc07bd", "blocks": ["b00012"], "source_kind": "B"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [], "knowledge_units": ["s-dbddd7fc07bd-c001:u006"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "case", "subtype": "case", "title": "讲师个人经历：在美国被正面提问导致成绩优异", "content": "讲师在美国读书时，因为是少数国际学生，老师经常笑眯眯看他，并因他喜欢问天马行空的问题而问他“你怎么那么聪明，你的脑子怎么想出那么奇妙的问题”，他每天都在寻找“我怎么那么聪明”的答案，结果第一年就拿全A，后来一路开挂，拿无数奖学金。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["正面提问", "成绩优异", "个人经历"], "evidence": "reported_case", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-dbddd7fc07bd-c001:a007", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-dbddd7fc07bd", "blocks": ["b00014"], "source_kind": "B"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-dbddd7fc07bd-c001:a005", "kind": "contrasts", "condition": null, "reason": "a007 是正面提问导致成绩优异，与 a005 负面批评性问题导致错误答案形成对比。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-dbddd7fc07bd-c001:u007"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "condition", "title": "家长日常话语对孩子大脑的影响", "content": "家长不要小看每天对孩子说的话，哪怕一句很平常的话，如果经常说，就要小心这些话对孩子大脑造成的影响。能够做到用诠释的方法引导孩子的左脑。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["日常话语", "大脑影响", "诠释"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-dbddd7fc07bd-c001:a008", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-dbddd7fc07bd", "blocks": ["b00014"], "source_kind": "B"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-dbddd7fc07bd-c001:a002", "kind": "association", "condition": "两者均涉及诠释方法，但无直接支持定义的关系。", "reason": "家长日常话语对孩子大脑的影响并提及使用诠释方法，但不直接支持诠释方法的定义本身。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "revised", "review_notes": "原支持关系改为关联；提及不等同于支持定义。"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-dbddd7fc07bd-c001:u008"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "condition", "title": "父母需要强烈好奇心以使用诠释方法", "content": "父母需要有非常强烈的好奇心，才能用诠释的方法引导孩子的左脑。父母往往习惯认为自己非常了解孩子，觉得孩子做什么、为什么做都一清二楚，不需要再问，因此没有习惯向孩子提出类似问题，往往心里已经替他们有了答案。在这里，“心有灵犀一点通”可不是一个好主意。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["好奇心", "父母习惯", "诠释"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-dbddd7fc07bd-c001:a009", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-dbddd7fc07bd", "blocks": ["b00016"], "source_kind": "B"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [{"target": "s-dbddd7fc07bd-c001:a002", "kind": "prerequisite", "condition": "强烈好奇心是使用诠释方法的前提。", "reason": "父母需要强烈好奇心才能用诠释方法引导孩子的左脑，因此好奇心是使用诠释方法的前提。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": "前提关系成立，方向正确。"}, {"target": "s-dbddd7fc07bd-c001:r002", "kind": "same_source_point", "condition": "Read both records and the shared source point; this is not a causal assertion.", "reason": "s-dbddd7fc07bd-c001:u009", "evidence": "point_source_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-dbddd7fc07bd-c001:u009"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "诠释方法锻炼左脑与情绪理解", "content": "孩子的左脑需要通过思考诠释性问题来锻炼，随着年龄增长，他对自己情绪的了解越来越深，相应也越来越能把控情绪所带来的行为。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["左脑锻炼", "情绪理解", "行为控制"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-dbddd7fc07bd-c001:a010", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-dbddd7fc07bd", "blocks": ["b00016"], "source_kind": "B"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-dbddd7fc07bd-c001:a002", "kind": "association", "condition": "两者均涉及诠释方法，但效果不能支持定义。", "reason": "诠释方法锻炼左脑与情绪理解说明该方法的效果，但不直接支持诠释方法的定义。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "revised", "review_notes": "原支持关系改为关联；效果与定义相关但非支持。"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-dbddd7fc07bd-c001:u010"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "case", "subtype": "case", "title": "爸爸与12岁儿子关于想家的对话案例", "content": "一个爸爸在12岁儿子准备去爷爷奶奶家度假打包衣服时，问“你会不会想家呢？”，儿子习惯性说“不知道”。爸爸接着问“如果想家了你怎么办呢？”，儿子还是说“不知道”。一般这种情况，很多父母会转移话题或直接走人，但这个爸爸非常有智慧，继续问“如果你开始觉得想家的时候做些什么会让你感觉好一点呢？”。儿子停下打包动作开始思考，过一阵说“我可以给你打电话或者和我的表哥去打球”。爸爸又问“为什么打球会缓解你想家呢？”。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["想家", "提问", "诠释", "同理心", "延伸"], "evidence": "reported_case", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-dbddd7fc07bd-c001:a011", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-dbddd7fc07bd", "blocks": ["b00018", "b00020"], "source_kind": "B"}, {"source_id": "s-dbddd7fc07bd", "blocks": ["b00018", "b00020"], "source_kind": "B"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "alternate_titles": ["爸爸与12岁儿子关于想家的对话案例（详细）"], "relations": [{"target": "s-dbddd7fc07bd-c001:a012", "kind": "example_of", "condition": "对话案例展示了三种方法的综合运用。", "reason": "爸爸与12岁儿子关于想家的对话案例是对话中三种方法综合运用这一总结的具体实例。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": "案例指向概念，方向正确。"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-dbddd7fc07bd-c001:u011"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded"}
